      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NITRO TOXIC (4) scored her maiden success two back but safely held last time when seventh and beaten 8 lengths at The Gardens over 400m (23.82) last time. Can turn form around here. MULWEE PRINCESS (2) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when second (22.77) at Gosford. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Likely to be in the finish again. SEE RED (7) was in the money two back in a Grade 5 at this track then jumped from a squeeze draw last time and was not far away when second (17.60) over 300m at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Well placed here and should do much better. TRALEE VIXEN (3) can sneak into the finish.",
